# Tooling requirements: Tailwind + Vite + React (this file is documentation only;
# `pip install -r requirements.txt` installs nothing — use npm for the stack below.)
#
# Node.js: LTS 20.x or 22.x — https://nodejs.org/
# Package manager: npm, pnpm, or Yarn
#
# Typical packages (after `npm create vite@latest` with React template):
#   Dependencies: react, react-dom
#   DevDependencies: vite, @vitejs/plugin-react
#
# Tailwind CSS v4 with Vite:
#   npm install -D tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite
# Wire `tailwindcss()` from `@tailwindcss/vite` in vite.config; in main CSS use:
#   @import "tailwindcss";
#
# Tailwind v3 (if you stay on PostCSS instead):
#   npm install -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
#   npx tailwindcss init -p
